From ccbf7cf38c88090a3e5c0f456dfb216b5a7ef5c9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Simone Caronni <negativo17@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 22:15:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 04/11] crypto: add SHA-256, X25519 and Steam's key exchange

IHS_CryptoKeyExchange matches Steam's CCrypto::PerformKeyExchange: the
SHA-256 digest of the X25519 shared secret. Implemented with mbedTLS'
ECP module and tested against the RFC 7748 vectors; builds with both
mbedTLS 2.28 and 3.6.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
